.p-2
    ng-container(*ngIf='store.persistence | async as saving')
        .small.text-warning.mb-2(*ngIf='saving.error', role='alert')
            div {{saving.error}}。{{saving.pending}} 条记录尚未写入，退出程序可能丢失。正在自动重试。
            button.btn.btn-sm.btn-link((click)='store.retrySaving()') 立即重试
        .small.text-muted.mb-2(*ngIf='saving.recovered && !saving.error') 已从历史记录恢复 {{saving.recovered}} 个会话。旧记录缺少服务器信息时，可以重新关联。
    .small.text-break.mb-2 {{target || '点击历史会话，连接对应服务器并恢复上下文'}}
    input.form-control.form-control-sm(placeholder='搜索会话', [(ngModel)]='query', aria-label='搜索 Agent 会话')
    .d-flex.align-items-center.mt-2
        label.me-auto
            input(type='checkbox', [(ngModel)]='allServers')
            |  全部服务器
        button.btn.btn-sm.btn-link((click)='refresh()') 刷新
        button.btn.btn-sm.btn-link((click)='load()', [disabled]='disabled') 新建
    label.small.mt-2
        input(type='checkbox', [(ngModel)]='showEmpty', (ngModelChange)='refresh()', [disabled]='busy', aria-label='显示空会话')
        |  显示空会话
    .d-flex.flex-wrap
        button.btn.btn-sm.btn-link((click)='selectVisible()', [disabled]='busy') 选择可删除项
        button.btn.btn-sm.btn-link((click)='checked.clear()', [disabled]='busy || !checked.size') 清除选择
        button.btn.btn-sm.btn-link.text-danger((click)='confirmDelete()', [disabled]='busy || !selectedVisible.length') 删除所选（{{selectedVisible.length}}）
    .p-2(*ngIf='pendingDelete.length', role='alert')
        .small 以下 {{pendingDelete.length}} 个会话的历史记录将永久删除：
        ul.small
            li(*ngFor='let entry of pendingDelete') {{entry.title || '未命名会话'}} · {{entry.user}}@{{entry.host}}
        .small 正在使用或仍关联 SSH 连接的会话不会删除。
        button.btn.btn-sm.btn-danger.mt-1((click)='remove()', [disabled]='busy') 确认删除
        button.btn.btn-sm.btn-link.mt-1((click)='pendingDelete = []', [disabled]='busy') 取消
    .small.text-muted(*ngIf='runtime?.activeRunId') 请先停止当前 Agent，再切换会话。
    .small.text-warning.text-break(*ngIf='notice') {{notice}}
    .small.text-danger.text-break(*ngIf='error', role='alert') {{error}}
.history-tree
    details(*ngFor='let group of groups; trackBy: groupKey', open)
        summary {{group.name}}
        .session-row(*ngFor='let entry of group.entries; trackBy: entryKey')
            input(type='checkbox', [checked]='checked.has(entry.id)', (change)='toggleChecked(entry.id)', [disabled]='busy || !!sessions.deletionBlockReason(entry.id)', [attr.aria-label]='"选择会话：" + (entry.title || "未命名会话")', [title]='sessions.deletionBlockReason(entry.id)')
            button.session((click)='open(entry)', [disabled]='busy', [class.selected]='selected?.id === entry.id')
                span {{entry.title || '未命名会话'}}
                small {{entry.updatedAt | date:'MM-dd HH:mm'}}{{runtime?.id === entry.id ? ' · 当前' : ''}}{{!entry.hasUserInput ? ' · 空会话' : ''}}
            button.btn.btn-sm.btn-link((click)='startRename(entry)', aria-label='重命名会话', title='重命名会话')
                i.fas.fa-pen
            button.btn.btn-sm.btn-link.text-danger((click)='confirmDelete(entry)', [disabled]='busy || !!sessions.deletionBlockReason(entry.id)', aria-label='删除会话', [title]='sessions.deletionBlockReason(entry.id) || "删除会话"')
                i.fas.fa-trash
            .input-group.p-1(*ngIf='renameId === entry.id')
                input.form-control.form-control-sm([(ngModel)]='renameText', maxlength='80', aria-label='会话名称', (keydown.enter)='rename()', (keydown.escape)='renameId = ""')
                button.btn.btn-sm.btn-primary((click)='rename()') 保存
                button.btn.btn-sm.btn-link((click)='renameId = ""') 取消
    p.p-2.text-muted(*ngIf='!groups.length') 暂无会话记录
.association.p-2(*ngIf='linking && selected')
    label.small 重新关联服务器（后续命令将在所选服务器执行）
    select.form-control.form-control-sm([(ngModel)]='profileId', aria-label='关联服务器')
        option(value='') 选择服务器
        option(*ngFor='let profile of profiles', [value]='profile.id') {{profile.name}}
    button.btn.btn-sm.btn-primary.mt-1((click)='associate()', [disabled]='!profileId || busy') 关联并打开
    button.btn.btn-sm.btn-link.mt-1((click)='linking = false', [disabled]='busy') 取消
